WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.125
A force has a size and a direction, so we draw it as an arrow.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.525
Each arrow's length shows the size, and it points the way the force acts.

3
00:00:12.954 --> 00:00:15.429
A bigger push gets a longer arrow.

4
00:00:16.231 --> 00:00:20.531
A force diagram shows every force on the object, each one named.
